  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a kazan cauldron over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the beef offal and cook until browned.",
    "Add the fish sauce, vinegar, black pepper, and salt, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the smoked paprika and stir to combine.",
    "Add 2 cups of water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 1 hour.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley.",
    "Serve the stew with toasted bread on the side."
